  "description": "星尘分布式核心客户端库。一行代码接入，提供配置下发、服务注册与发现、全链路追踪、APM 性能监控与日志上报。\nStardust distributed core client library. One-line integration for configuration delivery, service registration and discovery, distributed tracing, APM and log reporting.",
